    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n11722" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπείργᾰθον</span></b> , 
			Ep.
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποέργαθον</span> (also <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπεργ-</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hsch.
				</span></i>
			), poet. aor. 2 of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπείργω</span>:—<i>keep away,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Πηλείωνα δόλῳ ἀποέργαθε λαοῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					21.599
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥάκεα μεγάλης ἀποέργαθε
			οὐλῆς</span> he <i>pushed back</i> the rags <i>from</i> the
			scar, Od, <i><span class="en">
				21.221
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἢν μή μ᾽ ὁ κραίνων τῆσδε γῆς
					ἀπειργάθῃ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>OC</u>
					862
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
